              { "cells": ["would rather",         "глагол без to", "I would rather stay."] },
              { "cells": ["'d rather",             "сокращённо",     "I'd rather stay."] },
              { "cells": ["would rather … than",  "выбор из двух",  "I'd rather walk than drive."] },
